window.products.push({"id":476021,"name":"PelPro PP60 Pellet Stove for Home Heating Fireplaces - 60 lb Hopper, 33,200 BTU Heats up to 1,500 Sq. Ft. (40 Hrs), Easy-Dial Temp Control, Built-In T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1999.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zwklZ4EnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This PelPro PP60 is a low emissions pellet stove for home heating that provides warmth for up to 1,500 square feet and is an excellent option for homeowners looking to heat their living space. Featuring a 60-lb. hopper capacity for up to 40 hours of burn time, this EPA-certified pellet stove with 79.4% efficiency helps you get the most heat from your fuel and save you money. Our pellet heater features a built-in thermostat with a simple dial control that offers 10 variable heat settings to maintain optimal comfort in any space including older drafty houses, tiny homes, mobile homes (fresh air kit included), cabins, workshops, garages, and other areas. The included variable-speed blower circulates air effectively, ensuring the heat created by this pellet stove can spread evenly throughout your living space for consistent comfort. This fireplace stove holds up to almost 2 days worth of wood pellets, which provide better cost stability compared to oil, propane, or electricity. The PP60 is shipped assembled and bolted to a pallet for convenience and safety. PelPro pellet stoves are DIY (Do-It-Yourself) appliances that make financial sense by using economical wooden pellets as fuel. Low emissions PelPro pellet appliances are efficient, reliable, and affordable, and are designed to meet the emissions standards of all 50 states including Washington, Oregon, and California. PelPro stands behind its products with a team of professionals ready to answer your questions, and multiple online resources like installation, cleaning, and troubleshooting videos. The PelPro PP60 features up to 33,200 BTU input * Up to 1,500 sq. ft. heating capacity * Uses premium or standard grade wood pellets * 60-lb. hopper capacity * Variable speed blower * 300W auto-igniter * High efficiency * EPA-certified 79.4% * Emissions 0.7 gram/hr. * Dimensions 22\" W x 33\" H x 22\" D","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zwklZ4EnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PelPro","source_asin":"B0BPMV6FGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPMV6FGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPMV6FGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
