window.products.push({"id":476077,"name":"Emlim 50PCS Love Capsules in a Glass Bottles Cute Message Capsules Pills for Boyfriend/Girlfriend & Birthday Christmas Anniversary Graduation Mother's","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b-GI6PNzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"1. The love capsule pill comes in a mix of colors. The pill can be filled with wishpaper. On paper, you can write down your wishes or those of your loved one. Of course, it can also be used as a diary to record your daily emotions and secrets. 2 In each capsule, write down the words you want to say, roll them up one by one, and put them in the capsule at the same time, so each love capsule is a little love song of your own creation 3. Every love capsule can leave bits and pieces of us to record our love. Every love capsule contains a little secret, recording your or his life and desires, happiness or worries, thoughts and cares, your love and life. These little love pills are filled with endless affection. If you don't have the courage to speak your mind, this is a great way to show others how you feel. 4. Lovely and novel love pill information design, very fashionable and creative. Capsules are only suitable for romantic gifts between lovers. They can also be used as anniversary gifts, birthdays, Christmas anniversaries, graduation and other holiday gifts. They make a great gift for close friends, classmates, boyfriend/girlfriend and family, or as a romantic accessory for the holidays. 5.Each capsule contains a little secret, recording your and his life and thoughts, happiness and sadness, thoughts and worries, your love and life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b-GI6PNzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emlim","source_asin":"B0BK73FF9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK73FF9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK73FF9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":476078,"name":"Hallmark Keepsake Christmas Ornament 2018 Year Dated, A Christmas Story Leg Lamp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SxVPC9NnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"According to Ralphie's father, a leg lamp is the ultimate chic accessory for a living room. Now you can have one too - hanging on your Christmas tree, at least - to commemorate the hit holiday movie \"A Christmas Story.\" This whimsical Christmas tree ornament features real fringe trimming the lampshade and authentic fishnet fabric on the shapely leg base, just like the major award Old Man Parker won and proudly displayed on Cleveland Street. Artist crafted by Rodney Gentry, this Christmas tree ornament features fringe trim and fishnet fabric. Pre-packaged in a box for easy gift giving, preservation and storage. Dated 2018 in copyright. With unparalleled artistry and exceptional detail, each festive and collectible Keepsake Ornament is made for years of celebrations. From preserving precious memories to commemorating special milestones and interests, there's a Hallmark ornament for everyone on your gift list. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, gifts, gift wrap, ornaments and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way. Plastic Christmas tree ornament is lead-free and measures 1.87\" W x 5\" H x 1.87\" D.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SxVPC9NnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark","source_asin":"B0792LWK2N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0792LWK2N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0792LWK2N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":476079,"name":"SinoAcrylic 4 Tier Square Cupcake Stand With Unique Platinum Plate - Dessert Display Holders - Fantastic Stacked Party Cupcake Tree - Tiered Cake Stan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yLDO+VmDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fancy a birthday party? Or planning for a wedding? No matter the occasion, you can create a dazzling centerpiece with this three-tier dessert tower. Beautifully constructed of sturdy clear acrylic for a look that goes great with any season. The stand's towering design ensures that guests will have no trouble making their way to the food table. Plus, it holds a cake, cupcakes, muffins, or other personal-size confections, making it a great choice for parties large or small. Alternately, use it creatively as a stand for showcasing Christmas cookies, holding individual hors de oeuvres, or beautifully presenting fruit and other finger foods.Great for even the most space-restricted kitchens, the versatile unit can be disassembled and nested for a practical and storable addition to any serveware collection. The cupcake-and-dessert tower assembles easily and cleans up quickly by hand. 4 Tier Verbier Silver Square Cupcake Stand Dimensions and Specification Diameter of each tier: 6'' 8'' 10'' 12''  Thickness of each tier: 4mm  Height between each tier: 4\"  Total height of stand: 12\"  Holds approximately 36-50 pcs cupcakes Come with 3 rods,screws and rubber feet Perfect For: Holiday PartiesBirthday PartiesBrunch PartiesGraduationsAny other casual or non-casual get togethers Attention Each tier of the cupcake stand is covered with a thin adhesive film to help prevent it from scratches during transportation. We strongly advise our customer remove the layer before assemble the cupcake stand. Once you do so, you will find your product clear as crystal. Stay Stable Unlike other cupcake stands on the market, the center supporting rod come with screws. This will give you the most stable tower, so your beautiful cupcakes don't get ruined by someone bumping into the table!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yLDO+VmDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SinoAcrylic","source_asin":"B071G5H95K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071G5H95K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071G5H95K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
