window.products.push({"id":476120,"name":"Jettory Wine Opener - Professional Waiters Corkscrew w/Foil Cutter, Beer Opener & Dual Hinge for Wine Bottle - Stainless Steel Wine Key for Servers, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qHkrhwfhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed for Professionals - This premium stainless-steel wine key, curated by Jettory with sommeliers in mind, features an elegant wooden grip and is built to handle extensive use in hectic work environments. The waiter’s corkscrew can effortlessly handle any kind of cork or metal cap, while its sturdy and durable construction offers excellent balance. waiters corkscrew can effortlessly handle any kind of cork or metal cap, while its sturdy and durable construction offers excellent balance. Attention to Detail - The non-stick glided and even worm, with an inline groove that improves grip and minimizes cork crumbling, ensure that this wine opener can remove any cork, natural or synthetic, in just 5 turns or less. Its unique design also allows it to screw easily into dry cork, making it an essential tool for bartenders and wine servers. Effortless Uncorking - The double-hinged style of this waiter corkscrew wine opener features one hinge near the middle of the tool that is utilized first, and a second hinge at the end that provides leverage for easy extraction of corks without breakage, with minimal energy expenditure. All-in-One Waiters Corkscrew - This heavy-duty stainless steel corkscrew is not only an excellent wine opener that smoothly removes foils, but it also comes equipped with a serrated knife that reduces the risk of gliding and minimizes any foil or plastic shredding. It can effortlessly open beer bottles, making it a versatile tool for bartenders and wine servers. Convenient and Compact - The compact size of the Jettory wine opener makes it easy to store in any kitchen drawer, and its all-in-one design eliminates the need for additional tools. The Jettory corkscrew wine key is easy to use and can effortlessly open any bottle, without any awkward pulling or tugging. It's the perfect gift for wine lovers, along with a bottle of their favorite vintage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qHkrhwfhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jettory","source_asin":"B0C3Z4RH8N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3Z4RH8N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3Z4RH8N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
