window.products.push({"id":476181,"name":"Rajlinen Queen Size Cotton Sheets - 400 Thread Count Sheets - Queen Size Sheets Sets- Easy Fit - Queen Bed Sheets - - 15 Inch Deep Pocket Cotton Sheet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KMYzO7v+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GIZA COTTON SATIN WEAVE FINISH SHEETS: These 400 thread-count sheets are satin finish weave that will give luxury feel to your bedroom, guest room, kids room, RV, Camper, vacation home, or other space. Treat yourself or give the ultimate Valentine's Day, Christmas, Mother's or Father's Day gift. GIZA EGYPTIAN COTTON SHEETS : 400-thread-count 100% Giza Cotton Sheets Set, extra-long staple giza cotton sheets loved by customers for its naturally soft & comfortable feel. These are customers' choice for best cotton sheets because they truly feel like luxurious hotel sheets EASY FIT 360-DEGREE ELASTIC: Our deep pocket fitted sheets fit mattresses up to 18 inches deep, which is a universal size for most mattresses. All-around elastic provides a firm fit around your mattress to keep everything in place for restless sleepers. Deep pockets will still stay snug on mattresses less than 18 inches. LAY IN LUXURIOUS HOTEL QUALITY DURABLE GIZA SHEETS: If you love the luxury and durability of Hotel bed sheets and the look of smooth pillowcases, you’ll adore our 400-thread-count luxurious giza sheets. We use yarns made with 100% long staple giza cotton fibre. Indulge in soft bed sheets with detailed hem styling, also available in your choice of colors and sizes PREMIUM QUALITY BEDDING: Made using top notch materials densely woven from 100% giza cotton and a rich sateen weave, our luxurious sheets keeps you cool, comfortable, and breathable in all seasons. Sink in the comfort of our 100% giza cotton sheets that are natural cool and breathable sheets unlike microfiber. These sheets are independently tested and certified as STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX EASY TO MAINTAIN: Our bed sheets are machine washable and get softer over time.To improve durability, warm wash and light dry. Use a short dry cycle and pull your linens from the dryer as soon as it ends to keep it wrinkles less. Wash with similar colors do use any additional softner or washing stuffs 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We are so confident in the quality of our product and ensure a good night’s sleep knowing your affordable bedroom decor also comes with access to top-notch customer service! for any reason you don't like our bedsheets, you can return them within 30 days. We value your bedtime, so we design premium and durable bedding to help you fall into blissful slumber. Give the ultimate gift or pamper yourself. If you’re not completely satisfied, let us know and we’ll fix it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KMYzO7v+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rajlinen","source_asin":"B07HD1GD23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HD1GD23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HD1GD23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
