window.products.push({"id":476205,"name":"Storm on Pacific Coast by David Lloyd Glover, 18x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bhMJ9088L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features waves crashing against rocks. David Lloyd Glover has a 25 year internation reputation exhibiting in major galleries in the US, Canada, Mexico and Japan. His works have been acquired by collectors all over the world. Glover creates masterworks in watercolor on paper, gouache on paper, oil on canvas and acrylic on canvas with equal facility. After a career in the advertising industry he embarked on a full time vocation of creating fine art for gallery sales. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bhMJ9088L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BKFL7RO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BKFL7RO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BKFL7RO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":476206,"name":"Spaghetti Zucchini Pasta and Noodle Maker (4 in 1): Vegetable Spiralizer ­- Cucumber and Zucchini Slicer ­- Double Sided Vegetable/fruit Peeler ­- Gar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AraIGxlZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The product is a bundle of 4 items:  1x Vegetable Spiralizer - Black - With the spiral slicer you conjure up endless Julienne strips of carrot, radish, cucumber and all kinds of other firm vegetables. - The 2x3 mm or 3,5x5 mm spirals are perfect to create vegetable stir-fries or pasta dishes, and to decorate serving dishes. - Also great for garnishes, plating and decorating serving dishes. - It can be cleaned simply under running water. - Material: Plastic and Stainless steel  1x Cucumber and Zucchini Slicer - Yellow - It has been designed like a bolt with a spiral thread in the centre. You poke the start of the spiral thread into the centre of the cucumber and then twist. Holding the furthest end of the vegetable - the plastic blades in the centre then slice the cucumber or courgette into a perfect, continuous spiral. - It can be cleaned simply under running water. - Material: Plastic  1x Double Sided Vegetable/fruit Peeler - Red or Green (Random color - You can not choose the color) - This item is a fruit or vegetable peeler. An useful kitchen tool that can make peeling easier and quicker. It can be used to peel apples, potatoes, carrots, etc. - It can be cleaned simply. - Material: Plastic and Stainless Steel  1x Garlic Grinding Tool - Pink, Blue or Green (Random color- You can not choose the color) - This is a garlic grater with a removable hands-protecting cover. The cover can be installed to protect your hands when grinding or planning small things like garlic and removed to plane bigger things. Mini size and light weight make it easy for control and storage. - Sharp stainless steel grind board, easy to grate - It can be cleaned simply. - Material: Plastic and Stainless Steel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AraIGxlZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B017AIJ99M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017AIJ99M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017AIJ99M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
