window.products.push({"id":476220,"name":"Super 7.5 Quart Superior-Drainage Stainless Steel Colander Big Enough to Feed the Whole Family and Still Capture Every Grain of Rice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ruMnIScUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Large, sturdy, and multi-functional, the Super 7.5 Quart Stainless Steel Colander is constructed with 100% stainless steel, micro-perforated holes that are strategically designed for superior drainage while keeping even the smallest grains of cooked rice from seeping through. This contemporary large colander is bigger than most; the over 7.5 Qt size is large enough for your big family’s annual summer picnic or the Thanksgiving holiday get together. Now you can enjoy all of those mouth-watering home cooked meals without the fear of overflowing or spilled food. Use this colander with handles for all of your traditional baking recipes; whether you’re sifting flour for the perfect homemade cake recipe or sprinkling powdered sugar atop the Christmas cookies, this sleek multi-purpose colander will work like a charm. Thanks to the open bottom, raised construction, the Super 7.5 Quart Colander makes it ideal for pouring boiling water directly into the opening and letting the delicious food drain while preserving all the aromatic flavors and preventing it from coming in direct contact with the sink. With this modern colander you can ensure that your freshly washed bag of blueberries won’t go bad. Cleaning and storing is convenient — the Super 7.5 Quart Colander comes with two easy grip handles and anything from large bowls to pots and pans can fit right inside — eliminating clutter and saving extra space. Backed by Amazon’s A-Z 100% money-back guarantee, the Super 7.5 Quart Colander is a must have cooking utensil for any family who needs a high-quality strainer that can be used in a number of ways in the kitchen. This sleekly designed colander is an indispensable item in the kitchen and will come in handy in nearly every cooking occasion. Now you can cook those large traditional family meals and prepare your grandma’s special recipes all with one reliable, easy to use colander.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ruMnIScUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Our Home to Yours, LLC","source_asin":"B01ASETARQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ASETARQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ASETARQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
