window.products.push({"id":476465,"name":"Rluckstar Plush Fluffy Duvet Cover Plush Shaggy Luxury Ultra Soft Crystal Velvet Bedding Sets 3 Pieces (1 Faux Fur Duvet Cover + 2 Faux Fur Pillow cas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a-gXPfr9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester Microfiber LUXURY FLUFFY DUVET COVER: Our fluffy faux fur duvet cover and pillowcase set is made of microfiber shaggy fuzzy fur and ultra soft crystal velvet fabric. Dual side design wraps you around in the warmest and coziest snuggles with layered textures. Luxurious long furs looks fancy and feels feathery soft, elevating your bedroom decor with a luxurious touch. SIZE INFORMATION: Twin: 1 pc duvet cover 68\"x90\", 1 pc pillow sham 20\"x26\". Queen:1 pc duvet cover 90\"x90\", 2 pcs pillow shams 20\"x26\". King:1 pc duvet cover 104\"x90\", 2 pcs pillow shams 20\"x36\". Wrapped with bow knot ribbons, comes with a blue tote bag, a great gift for everybody, every festival and special occasions. METAL ZIPPER AND CORNER TIES - Sturdy metal hidden zipper design easy to separate and launder. you will not disturb by broken zipper anymore,Zipper closure reduce your time on bed making process to seal your quilt, comforter or duvet easier and quicker than regular button closure. Four corner ties inside help to to ensure your comforter fit cover properly even if you move constantly at night. EASY CARE: Turning it inside-out and the bedding set with cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry on low heat, do not bleach / iron. Please follow the wash label for details. Comb through the long furs afterwards to restore their fluffiness and smoothness. Any reason you are not happy with these products, contact us for a 30 day full refund, you are also welcome to contact Cottonblue Customer Care for any inquiries. 100% Satisfaction Service: Appreciate you love our faux fur bedding set,but for some reason if you are not happy with this product,just return it within 30 days for a full refund with no questions asked.We are committed to your shopping experience,please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a-gXPfr9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rluckstar","source_asin":"B097TR3LTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097TR3LTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097TR3LTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
