window.products.push({"id":476488,"name":"Bambu Coasters with Bee Motif, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YZhiRgcFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bambu at Home is a distinctive range of contemporary products for the kitchen and home made from renewable materials. Bambu products are created with imagination and integrity and are intended to be used and enjoyed everyday. Our designs celebrate form, color and texture using low impact materials and processes. The products are tested and approved for food safety and all packaging materials are made from certified 100% recycled fiber or is recyclable. We strive to reduce the impact we place on the earth’s resources and take a socially responsible approach to our products, processes and practices. Certified Organic bamboo means our bamboo is grown without chemicals and pesticides. We believe it is not just about the end product but about the entre process. Not just about what you make, but about how you make it and under what conditions. And it’s not just about your beliefs, but instead about your social and environmental actions. The Serveware range is ‘carbonized’ to a rich golden brown. This means that the bamboo is oven baked and involves no stains or dyes. We’ve designed a range of products to be used for almost any occasion. From small condiment cups for dips and sauces, to a range of hors d’oeuvres tray and salad bowls. Bambu's Serveware collection is proudly made in China. The group we work with is organized as a cooperative, which means the craftspeople are involved in setting the pricing levels. Our producers only use water-based formaldehyde-free adhesives. No animal products are used in the ingredients or in the production process. All products are hand sanded and finished using a food-safe oil produced from vegetable oils and waxes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YZhiRgcFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bambu","source_asin":"B00B07MPBO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B07MPBO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B07MPBO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":476489,"name":"Chic 40th Birthday - Pink, Black and Gold - DIY Party Supplies - Birthday Party DIY Wrapper Favors & Decorations - Set of 15","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dTAqiralL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our do it yourself birthday party favor wraps are a versatile party supply that will help you easily style the perfect party. These milestone Chic 40th Birthday Pink, Black and Gold DIY wrappers are fun beverage wraps that will cover up unsightly labels on water bottles, juice containers or cans of soda - any item that is less than 11\" circumference, and dress up place-settings when used as napkin wraps. You can also them to make party favors. Our unique design lets you change their size, allowing you to wrap them around items ranging from 7\" around to 11\" circumference. Enjoy decorating your party with our original DIY party wrappers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dTAqiralL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B011F5V2OQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011F5V2OQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011F5V2OQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
