window.products.push({"id":476534,"name":"Trash and Recycling Stickers - 4\" х 4\" Recycle and Trash Stickers - Pack of 4 - Trash and Recycle Stickers - Waste Management Sticker - Trash Recycle ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PrfHhwFAS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Package includes: 2 Pack trash stickers (Black) and 2 recycle stickers (Green). Size: 4 x 4 inches.Recycle bin sticker is easy to apply. Recycle sticker for trash can large made from high-quality vinyl intended for outdoor and indoor use - guaranteed that trash recycle stickers stay firmly in place. The recycling stickers for trash can large do not fade in the sun, is easy to mount and remove, does not leave stains and sticky marks.Premium stickers made to the highest standards. Professionally printed with sharp detail and vibrant color. Each of these vinyl stickers is printed onto vinyl using a wide-format printer. We load a roll of digital vinyl that absorbs the inks we use and keeps them looking great for ages. We start with solvent based inks that are scratch resistant, UV resistant and waterproof, with a special air release technology. Recommended surfaces for using vinyl sticker ⚠️: glass, metal, Ceramic tile wall, smooth wood, plastic. NO DUST AND NO WET!!! ⛔ Vinyl stickers cannot be used on non-smooth surfaces such as granite, concrete, asphalt, gypsum, plaster, etc. So you’ve found the perfect surface for your vinyl sticker. What now? It’s always a good idea to clean your chosen surface. Remove all the dust, grime and grease in order to make sure the vinyl sticker has the longest possible lifetime. When cleaning the surface you should use a methylated spirit to get the best results. This is the best way to clean the surface. Avoid using a cleaner which contains oil because this will affect how well the sticker sticks. Easy to add (Instruction) 1 - We recommend you to thoroughly clean and dry the desire application surface to remove any dust or grease.2 - Carefully peel the backing paper from the decal at a sharp angle.3 - Align the decal and press in onto the desire surface.4 - Firmly run a credit card across the sticker to make sure the decal adheres to the surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PrfHhwFAS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DIMARONGTON","source_asin":"B099NTMPH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099NTMPH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099NTMPH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
