window.products.push({"id":476537,"name":"Warmfill Dish Drying Rack, 304 Stainless Steel 2 Tier Dish Rack with Drainboard Utensil Holder for Kitchen Counter, Space Saving Dish Dryer Rack, Silv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tmfHY6zgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ Compact Yet Large Capactiy: Size of 16.6 \"L x 9.7\"W x 15.9 \"H, the stainless steel dish rack takes up less counter space but has considerably more capacity.The upper tier of this dishes drying rack can place up to 17 plates, the lower tier can place up to 18 bowls cups，pots, pans. Apart from the spoon holder, there is also a knife holder and cutting board holder, great for small space ✅ Well Constructed & Sturdy: Compared with ordinary dish drying rack with upright feet, this 2 tier drying rack with lengthen bend feet bear heavy weight much better without wobbles. Stable enough to move around even when loaded with plates. The load bearing of our dish rack is up to 110 lbs ✅ Anti-rust & Durable: Made of premium 304 STAINLESS STEEL, the rack of dishes is rustproof and durable for years to come, perfect for kitchen organization. The stainless steel look enhances the compelling style of your kitchen too ✅ Keep Countertop Dry: Each tier of this black dish drainer has it's own drain tray underneath to prevent water drain on to the countertop or rewetting the other dried dishes, keep your kitchen countertop dry. The drip trays can easily slips in and out for quick clean-up ✅ Easy Set-up: We provide a detailed installation instruction for this drying rack dishes. All parts, tools, and instructions needed are included. You can easily complete the installation within a few minutes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tmfHY6zgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warmfill","source_asin":"B0868171CL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0868171CL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0868171CL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":476538,"name":"Peugeot Baya Salt Mill, Chocolate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dOl9g+XnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"PEUGEOT: France, since 1810. Peugeot mills are renowned by chefs and gourmet cooks the word over for the consistent grind results they produce, their incredible resilience and proven reliability. Compromise is not a word that fits into the Peugeot vocabulary. For each spice, there is one – and only one – Peugeot grinding mechanism: peppercorns; coarse dry salt; chilies; herbs and spices; wet salts; and nutmeg. Add the coffee mechanism, which started it all and there are seven unique Peugeot mechanisms. Each is designed to derive the most flavor and greatest aroma from its complementary spice. Aesthetically pleasing, Peugeot mills deliver the height of quality, durability, reliability and innovation; making these mills the ones to which all others are compared. The high quality beech wood used in Peugeot mills is grown, harvested, dried, shaped and finished in France. The Baya mills are available as either pepper or salt mills in a varnished finish. For Peugeot Classic mills, the grind is adjusted by turning the top nut: turn it clockwise (tighten) for a finer grind; counter-clockwise (loosen) for a coarser grind. Mill stands 3-inch tall with a natural finish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dOl9g+XnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B0073TWZO0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0073TWZO0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0073TWZO0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
