window.products.push({"id":476940,"name":"Candle Warmer Lamp, Dimmable Candle Warmer Lantern with Timer, Wax Melt for Scented Candles, Compatible with Candle Small & Large Jar Candles, Top Can","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-yfR6PrxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Elegant Home Decor】An elegant and minimalist candle warmer lamp is definitely a decorative items to match your house. Soft halogen light (Included 2 x 50 watt bulbs ) creates a cozy atmosphere, and candle warmer lantern distributes your favorite candle scent evenly throughout the room for a happiness and soothing at the end of the day. 【Safety & Environmental】The principle of the candle wax warmer is to use candle warmer light bulb to heat the candles from top to down, so that the surface of the scented candle is evenly heated and melted. No open fire, smokeless, no pollution and reduces fire risk. Our wax warmer for scented candle helps better emiting pure fragrance. Safer to use, avoid accidental injury to pets or babies. 【Multi-functional Candle Lamp】The candle warmer lamp are not only wax melt warmer, but also a night light that is suitable for bedroom, living room and study. The control button allows you to control the temperature by adjusting the light, thus controlling the scent concentration of the scented candle. The timing switch provides 3 timing duration options(2H/4H/8H) to accompany you safely to sleep in a quiet night. 【Fits All Candle Sizes】Height between base and candle lamp head is 6.5 inch, the diameter of the wood base is 6 inch. The wax warmers ​compatible with fits all size candles such as large jar candles, Bath and Body Work 3 Wick candles etc. 【Candle Lover Perfect Gift】This electric scented wax warmer s a stylish, modern, exquisite and creative candle melting lamp. The wax melter will be the best gift choice to show your love to your families, lover, or friends on Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year, Housewarming or other special occasions. ​Enjoy the fragrance of your favorite scented candles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-yfR6PrxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Novamer","source_asin":"B0BZV1HD37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-476940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZV1HD37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZV1HD37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
